// Syncthing ignore rules for the Brosr folder.
//
// Synced: plan.md, core/, spike/ source, fixtures, results.json.
// Not synced: anything a spike run, a build or the OS generates, because each machine
// produces its own and a shared copy only causes conflicts and wasted bandwidth.

// Git's own bookkeeping. Both machines write an index and objects, and a shared .git
// produced 7 conflict copies inside it on 13 November 2026. Each machine keeps its own
// history and pushes to origin, so this directory never syncs again.
.git

// The spike downloads Firefox Nightly and uBlock Origin here, writes four profiles and
// encodes the 120 s test clip with ffmpeg. 794 MB on this machine, rebuilt by `node run.mjs`.
// Rooted with the leading slash, because only the spike's copy is generated.
/spike/.runtime

// Node and package manager state.
node_modules
.npm
.pnpm-store

// Launcher build output, for the Tauri, Vite and Rust layout the plan calls for.
target
dist
build
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo

// Run, build and test output that is regenerated everywhere.
*.log
coverage
*.profraw

// OS and editor metadata. (?d) lets Syncthing delete these when it needs to.
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d)desktop.ini
(?d).localized
